# Full-build context stays tiny (~7KB): nothing outside TS source matters to
# the builder. migrations/ is bind-mounted by the compose services at runtime
# (node-pg-migrate reads it from the mount, not the image), so it does not
# need to ship inside the image.
.git
.github
.claude
.env*
docs
scripts
infra
evals
specs
migrations
test
dist
docker-compose*.yml
Dockerfile*
Makefile
node_modules
coverage
*.md
tmp